@page "/notification-templates/{Id:guid}"

@*
   The template detail route (redesign spec §3.1/§3.5): a thin host around the shared editor in Edit mode.
   Type and contact mode render as locked indicators there; the action bar carries Save and the audited
   Reset; the audit trail sits below the two-column layout. The address is the template''s own, so it can
   be bookmarked and shared.
*@
<PageTitle>Notification Template</PageTitle>

<TemplateEditor Mode="TemplateEditorMode.Edit" Id="Id" />

@code {
    /// <summary>The template this page addresses (the route id).</summary>
    [Parameter] public Guid Id { get; set; }
}